.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK ATTRIBUTE TRANSITION"
.SH NAME
hamstik attribute transition \- Change a definition's lifecycle state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik attribute transition [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change a definition's lifecycle state
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Stable Attribute key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --state
Target lifecycle state
Choices: active, disabled, retired
.TP
.B --reason
Optional audit reason
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
